# Environment
# Ignore every .env variant — including timestamped backups like
# .env.bak-mailcow-20260816T221809Z, which the old `.env` / `.env.local` pair
# did NOT match and which a `git add -A` would have committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
mail_settings.txt
db_settings.txt

